// Go workspace for the MDDB monorepo.
//
// This file is for LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY — it enables cross-module
// refactoring, unified `go build ./...` from the repo root, and gopls
// "goto definition" across module boundaries.
//
// CI INTENTIONALLY DISABLES WORKSPACE MODE via `GOWORK=off` in
// .github/workflows/test.yml. Each module's tests, vet, and build
// run in isolation to catch missing `require` entries that workspace
// mode would hide.
//
// Every module listed here must also maintain its own go.mod with
// complete `require` entries so it builds standalone when GOWORK=off.
//
// NOT listed here:
//   - ./test — pre-existing package-level conflicts
//     (multiple files declaring `package main` with duplicate symbols).
//     Can be added after the benchmark scripts are split into
//     per-subdirectory packages. Its go.mod has `replace mddb => ../services/mddbd`
//     which serves the same purpose standalone.

go 1.26

use (
	./services/mddbd
	./services/mddb-cli
	./tools/bench
)
